    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "fa5138d63e83a53eba4de11fb238be3ee67f5b5ce7a19b440ba11ffcc4a674a2",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 11,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "好きな性癖発表獣神ですの！？\nここでは負けましたが、あれを使えばあなたたちなんて――！",
      "jp_sha256": "7ec028d0c232ef8e25c1b05512d32cc22e9c4a1fb3b829eaaa621a6b201b2289",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "좋아하는 성벽 발표 짐승신입니까!?\n여기서는 졌지만, 저걸 쓰면 너희 따위――!",
      "message_index_0based": 11,
